Prompt: Build a Sticky Notes Browser Extension (Microsoft Edge / Chrome)

Build a complete Microsoft Edge / Google Chrome browser extension using Manifest V3 called Sticky Notes.

Generate all files required for a working extension:

manifest.json
popup.html
popup.css
popup.js

The extension must run entirely locally and must not require:

Any backend
Any database
Any API
Any internet connection
Any external libraries

Use only vanilla HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

Purpose

The extension acts as a digital sticky notes application.

The user has 5 independent colour-coded sticky notes.

Each note is selected by clicking a coloured square at the top of the popup.

Each note has its own content.

Switching between notes should instantly switch the text displayed in the textarea.

